   {
    "context": "And it's all New Testament, by the way. I'm so sick of this religion avoiding accountability for its leaders. And because of all of that, you have what we would expect to see a young person harmed, confused, blaming themselves, stuck in doubt and fear, and still desperately trying to stay in the system that harmed them and please the God that forsook them.",
