    "title": "A Biblical Analysis of Infant Baptism",
    "video_id": "nOa1hulVSxE"
   },
   {
    "context": "That that means that there will be outliers like me who are accountable to no one, but that's actually not the reality of it, and on top of that, I don't even think that God solves that problem because there's clearly people who believe in God who do reprehensible things, and I was saying this to Paul earlier, they've also got another level to escape accountability because they can atone.",
