    "video_id": "niqY-Jc99MM"
   },
   {
    "context": "And it's really important to place that accountability in our own minds where it actually belongs, because the risk of not as huge. One, we can walk away from the truth of the God who designed you and sacrificed on the cross for you and loves you.",
