    "video_id": "YjfyE6-uI1c"
   },
   {
    "context": "That kind of belief reshapes everything. How people see life, themselves, others, value, and control. It doesn't restrain harm, it rebrands it. Accountability gets skipped in systems built on appearances where image matters more than integrity. Confession becomes PR, not justice. So the question isn't where is God? The real question is where is the accountability?",
