  ],
  "1": [
   {
    "context": "But we have to learn how to do that with the grace of helping people realize that this is not accountability is not an attack. Uh but saying the words is not enough, though, right? We also have to phrase accountability where it doesn't come off as an attack, right? So but that's that's that's work that the secular community can do for sure. Um, is helping us all get comfortable because here's the thing I tell people like I didn't think you were perfect, so you you might as well get rid of me to see what's wrong with you because I don't think anybody's perfect, so I'm gonna say that all the damn time.",
